 win the free skate, a lower-ranked skater could move up to first position, but this would rarely happen at international competitions. The same principle of scoring by factored placements was applied in pairs and ice dancing."] "\n\n" [:p {} "One other difference in 1984 was that the Soviet Union did not have the favorite in one of the couples’ events. In ice dancing, the British dance couple of " [:a {:href "/athletes/82881"} "Jayne Torvill"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/85109"} "Christopher Dean"] " – Torvill &amp; Dean, or T&amp;D for short – had won the last several World Championships and were expected to put on a show. They would not disappoint."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/13722"} "Singles, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "13 – 16 February 1984"] "\n" [:td {} "23"] "\n" [:td {} "15"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/13754"} "Singles, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "15 – 18 February 1984"] "\n" [:td {} "23"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/13786"} "Pairs, Mixed"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "10 – 12 February 1984"] "\n" [:td {} "30"] "\n" [:td {} "7"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/13807"} "Ice Dancing, Mixed"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "10 – 14 February 1984"] "\n" [:td {} "38"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n114 (57/57)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n20 (18/19)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"}